OL,3,GNEWSASurprise party for veteran on his
OL,4,A102nd birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn RAF veteran has celebrated his 102nd
OL,7,Fbirthday at his care home in North
OL,8,FLincolnshire.
OL,10,FAlfred "Eddie" Instone served in the
OL,11,FRAF as a wireless mechanic, and in 1946
OL,12,Fhe was part of a team who flew a fleet
OL,13,Fof Lancaster bombers to tour the US.
OL,15,FIt was known as Operation Lancaster and
OL,16,Fwas a goodwill tour after World War
OL,17,FTwo.
OL,19,FRAF personnel, his family and staff at
OL,20,Fhis care home in Brigg held a surprise
OL,21,Fbirthday party for him.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
